+     * A guest PAUSE is an explicit deterministic scheduler yield.  Commit the
+     * early handoff as canonical cursor state rather than retaining a partial
+     * turn: retaining it lets a lock owner reacquire before a waiting vCPU can
+     * run and can starve firmware or guest spin locks forever.
